{"title":"2013 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 7b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1.1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1.1</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/a/e4a9440e7395ecdb35bccc2c4d7879649cc5efcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\cos x} - \\tan x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"139\" height=\"38\" />, what is the numerical value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/8/6e8f3a072de64627a11a2df663e577eb43d60c77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin x$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/adde925229e3add802cd02367f60916d24b0e6ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = ag(x) + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/9/c39dd522dbd111deb0f7dc39b40ea572b37b6c70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = \\frac{x - b}{a} = \\frac{x}{a} - \\frac{b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"179\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b03f043b1dbaf34682f3fea8521c7d13ba26f65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) - g(x) = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/646336ccb5f4473c0fd7543c9ec2d0f552e47860.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax + b - \\frac{x}{a} + \\frac{b}{a} = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"167\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/b/bebe30c2699d3870c82bbd8114f3e7a8c96a6f42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a - \\frac{1}{a})x + (b + \\frac{b}{a}) = 0x + 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"236\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Since this is true for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e77115708f58ed784a12411c2197364a68caa94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a - \\frac{1}{a} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/7/fb782920b6f958b05bd08a48ddad41a901937c47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + \\frac{b}{a} = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"39\" />. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/4/0f49489cad0aace5ca7474e0128fe2b4f6a04acc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2} - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35496101e151991fc3213a7472ade63fd75bdf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/b/b1bf8d0c7f2871f83cb72394d9b36c800e7109ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + \\frac{b}{1} = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"39\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/d/63dba61f2eeaea7c2af0246b19d26b130191b4a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/3/1833899494ab26da11b2b568700e937b4e64d0fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{44}{2} = 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />. This would correspond to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfb25c830f2ef817e8c6f5347c72e46f04a462f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x + 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35496101e151991fc3213a7472ade63fd75bdf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/9/b69f535bdee4a8417c14adf445c84c6e5461c488.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + \\frac{b}{-1} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"92\" height=\"41\" />. However, this must be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b45828f292e161290be6ee62bc4c9df081ee1e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so this doesn't work out.\n</p><p>Thus, the only possible linear function is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/2/e62e022937d9c96adbc30afe94ea70edb379fd45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{f(x) = x + 22}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"124\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1.1\">Solution 1.1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1.1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the same steps as solution 1, until we get this:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/b/bebe30c2699d3870c82bbd8114f3e7a8c96a6f42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a - \\frac{1}{a})x + (b + \\frac{b}{a}) = 0x + 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"236\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Since this is true for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we can plug-in different values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to see what we get for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/7/fb782920b6f958b05bd08a48ddad41a901937c47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + \\frac{b}{a} = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/e/e4ee25cf5c97acfc85f93f16c2434e73f41efd0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ab + b}{a} = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/b/26b35766a1f98740c053f6dd3d88cf9fdbf8b996.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/d/69d2d30cb62d7b8c4156a0f0efc9acd5f2531dfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a - \\frac{1}{a}) \\times b + b + \\frac{b}{a} = 0 \\times b + 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"261\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb5abb82d74ee4b59d5a2313740cc2a8b027ad1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab - \\frac{b}{a} + b + \\frac{b}{a} = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"163\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/433a2673f7e007c079845a5f80556aa79016fca8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab + b = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/e/e4ee25cf5c97acfc85f93f16c2434e73f41efd0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ab + b}{a} = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"39\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/1/a0183510f11cd7e25269e98fb39f5aa61f914197.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{44}{a} = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>We then see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/433a2673f7e007c079845a5f80556aa79016fca8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab + b = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/7/1078dc3effb88c8023f41ff119f4f386f34cb242.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + b = 44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/3/1833899494ab26da11b2b568700e937b4e64d0fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{44}{2} = 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>From this, we see that the equation of the line must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/2/e62e022937d9c96adbc30afe94ea70edb379fd45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{f(x) = x + 22}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"124\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232429\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 183/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7839/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.004      1 2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_7\n100.00%    6.004      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36334:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232429 and revision id 281384. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}